# T22652 read alarm information. MV5 alarms at 0x3000, 6 words each [type, config, 0, 0, 0, status].
# Status expectations are THIS bench's power inputs: Power Input 1 Yes / No / Yes on members 1 / 3 / 4.
step SETUP
cli configure terminal ;; scada modbus tcp server ;; end
cli show alarm facility settings =~ External PSU
cli show system environment =~ Power Input 1
step case-literal addresses (older map)
read 1 0x3600 1 ENUM exc
read 1 0x3601 1 HEX exc
read 1 0x3602 1 BOOL exc
step 1 #1 Alarm Type
read 1 0x3000 1 ENUM 1 External PSU
read 3 0x3000 1 ENUM 1
read 4 0x3000 1 ENUM 1
step 2 #1 Alarm Configuration
read 1 0x3001 1 HEX 0000 CLI Outputs "-"
read 3 0x3001 1 HEX 0000
read 4 0x3001 1 HEX 0000
step 3 #1 Alarm Status
read 1 0x3005 1 BOOL False Power Input 1 Yes
read 3 0x3005 1 BOOL True Power Input 1 No
read 4 0x3005 1 BOOL False Power Input 1 Yes
step TEARDOWN
cli configure terminal ;; no scada modbus tcp server ;; end
probe 502 refused
